" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"header\" data-bl-label=\"Getting to Chicago\"><img class=\"bd-bloom bd-bloom--pagehead\" src=\"/media/botanical-deco/botanical/corner-tl-138.webp\" width=\"138\" height=\"278\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-media=\"botanical.corner-tl\" data-bl-m=\"art\"><span class=\"bd-pagehead__skyline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><div class=\"bd-pagehead__inner\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Travel &amp; Stay</span></p><h1 class=\"bd-h bd-h--1 bd-pagehead__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Getting to Chicago</span></h1><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-lede bd-pagehead__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We know many of you will be traveling to join us, and we’re grateful you’re making the trip. Here’s some helpful information to make planning your stay a little easier. We’ll add more details as our plans come together.</span></p></div></header><section id=\"arriving\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--paper\" aria-labelledby=\"arriving-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Getting to Chicago\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"arriving-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Getting to Chicago</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We recommend flying into O'Hare (ORD). There is no wedding shuttle; take the CTA Blue Line “L” train into downtown. Visit the</span><!-- --> <a class=\"bd-link\" href=\"https://www.transitchicago.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Transit </span><span class=\"bd-nowrap\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Authority</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"bd-external\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></span></span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> for routes and service information.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Rideshare pickup details at the airport are coming soon. Uber can take you from the airport to the hotel.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Midway (MDW) also serves Chicago with trains, taxis, and rideshare into downtown.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">By train: </span><a class=\"bd-link\" href=\"https://www.amtrak.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span class=\"bd-nowrap\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Amtrak</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"bd-external\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></span></span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> serves Chicago's Union Station from cities throughout the country.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">By car: valet parking is $84 per night with in-and-out privileges at the 71 E Madison entrance. Millennium Park Garage (6 S. Columbus Dr.) and Millennium Lakeside Garage (5 S. Columbus Dr.) are nearby alternatives. Check </span><a class=\"bd-link\" href=\"https://www.millenniumgarages.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Millennium </span><span class=\"bd-nowrap\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Garages</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"bd-external\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></span></span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> for current rates and reservations. Parking rates and availability may change before the wedding.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"/trip\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Your guest travel details and weekend plans →</span></a></p></div></div></section><section id=\"airports\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--paper\" aria-labelledby=\"airports-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Two airports serve Chicago\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"airports-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Two airports serve Chicago</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"bd-travel__airports\"><article class=\"bd-card\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"O'Hare International Airport\"><div class=\"bd-card__inner\"><span class=\"bd-card__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">ORD</span></span><h3 class=\"bd-card__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">O'Hare International Airport</span></h3><div class=\"bd-card__body\"><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We recommend flying into O’Hare. There is no wedding shuttle; take the CTA Blue Line “L” train into downtown. Rideshare pickup details are coming soon; Uber can take you from the airport to the hotel.</span></p></div></div></div></article><article class=\"bd-card\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Chicago Midway International Airport\"><div class=\"bd-card__inner\"><span class=\"bd-card__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">MDW</span></span><h3 class=\"bd-card__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Chicago Midway International Airport</span></h3><div class=\"bd-card__body\"><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Midway also serves Chicago with 